</div>          </div>          <div n="1" type="jPoliticalNews">             <div n="2" type="jArticle" xml:id="a2b" prev="#a2a" next="#a2c">                <p>ausgezeichneter foren&#x017F;i&#x017F;cher Redner die Ge&#x017F;chwor-<lb/>
